X:1
T:Just As I Am Without One Plea
T:WOODWORTH
C:Music: William B. Bradbury, 1849 · Words: Charlotte Elliott, 1835
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "The New Hymnal (Episcopal)", 1916 Hymn 139 (second tune) transposed down on half step into the more modernly used key of D. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/woodworth_bradbury): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
