w: And * that Thou bid- dest me come to Thee, * O Lamb of God, * I come, I come. *
w: To * Thee, Whose blood * can cleanse each spot, * O Lamb of God, * I come, I come.  *
w: Figh- * tings and fears * with- in, with- out, * O Lamb of God, * I come, I come.  *
w: Yea, * all I need, * in Thee to find, * O Lamb of God, * I come, I come.  *
